    "title": "Check for Understanding",
    "long_instructions": "**Directions:** These statements should be from the perspective of the persona and explain what they, personally, value or find frustration with when it comes to data rights. A few sample statements are provided below:\r\n- Data should never be provided to other parties without my explicit consent and permission in writing\r\n- Data should be available more easily for those in the law enforcement community so that we can investigate and solve crimes quicker and easier.\r\n\r\n\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid black;\">\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; padding: 10px;\">\r\n      <h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Raven, The Community Health Advocate</h1>\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td style=\"width: 40%; border: 1px solid black; padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">\r\n      <img src=\"https://images.code.org/c20a5888585cad999f865b4fc9c77b0d-raven2.png\" style=\"width: 33%;\"/>\r\n      <hr>\r\n      <div style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n        <h2>Background:</h2>\r\n        <p>Raven is a 29-year-old community health advocate from the Red River Nation who helps local families promote wellness. After participating in research using community health and genetic data, she grew concerned about how that data is collected and shared. Raven is passionate about ensuring her community can control and benefit from its own information.</p>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td style=\"width: 70%; border: 1px solid black; padding: 10px;\">\r\n    <h2 style=\"margin-top: 0;\">Key Experiences:</h2>\r\n    <ul style=\"font-size: 16px;\">\r\n        <li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"> Raven learned that genetic data collected from her community years ago was later shared with outside research institutions without the tribe’s explicit consent. She felt this violated their cultural values and trust.\r\n            </li>\r\n        <li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">A university recently asked to use her organization’s health data to “advance medical equity,” but Raven noticed the agreement didn’t include any guarantee that the community would have access to or ownership of the results.</li>\r\n        <li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">Some elders in the community have stopped participating in health studies altogether because they fear misuse of their data. Raven worries this could lead to fewer resources and underrepresentation in medical research.</li>\r\n      </ul>\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### Write 1-2 **data rights statement(s)** that would reflect the viewpoint of this stakeholder based on his/her key experiences:\r\n\r\n",
